# Trade Agreement Entry
This scope computes the key dates related to the entry into force and subsequent obligations of the trade agreement.

```catala
declaration scope TradeAgreementEntry:
  input latest_notification_date content date
  input us_submission_period content duration
  output entry_into_force_date content date
  output us_submission_deadline content date
```

## Entry into Force

The Agreement shall enter into force 14 days after the date of receipt of the date of the latest notification.

```catala
scope TradeAgreementEntry:
  date round down
  definition entry_into_force_date equals latest_notification_date + 14 day
```

## US Submission Deadline

The United States of America shall submit for publication within 21 days of entry into force of this agreement.

```catala
scope TradeAgreementEntry:
  definition us_submission_deadline equals entry_into_force_date + us_submission_period
```